    title: FACTORIES!
    body: 'Factories spawn randomly upon unlocking a zone. Every passing day, there''s
      a chance for the factory to dump trash around its surroundings.


      Be
      wary, as some types of trash can cause contamination to the tile underneath!'
  - speaker: 2
    customName: 
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0b22609174e42604784f82d385ac418e, type: 3}
    portraitAnimatorOverride: {fileID: 0}
    title: CONTAMINATION!
    body: 'A buildup of contamination leads to purple tiles.


      Rinorea and
      Sunflowers are your best bet for eating away at high levels of contamination
      like these.'
